<!--
    Declarative baseline — configuration only, deliberately NO ApexClass and
    NO ApexTrigger.

    This is the manifest that proves the core thesis of the Platform App Builder
    curriculum: 100% of the business requirements in phases 1-8 can be met without
    writing a single line of code. Use this to demonstrate that a solution built
    on configuration is complete on its own.

        sf project deploy start --manifest manifest/package-declarative.xml
-->
